WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.758 --> 00:00:08.829
Staff reviews collect the feedback venue managers give your staff after a shift.

2
00:00:08.829 --> 00:00:12.471
This tutorial uses fictional demonstration data.

3
00:00:12.924 --> 00:00:17.068
Open Users, and select View on a staff member.

4
00:00:17.531 --> 00:00:22.580
Open the More menu beside the tabs, and choose Staff reviews.

5
00:00:23.036 --> 00:00:28.929
Overall rating shows the average score, and how the reviews are spread from one to

6
00:00:28.929 --> 00:00:29.719
five stars.

7
00:00:30.179 --> 00:00:36.188
Average by category breaks the score down into grooming, attitude, skills,

8
00:00:36.188 --> 00:00:38.462
attendance and time keeping.

9
00:00:38.924 --> 00:00:44.922
Use the venue manager and date range filters to narrow the reviews, for example to

10
00:00:44.922 --> 00:00:45.727
this month.

11
00:00:46.182 --> 00:00:52.776
Review history lists each review. Select View review to see the full shift review.

12
00:00:53.230 --> 00:00:59.313
The shift review shows each category score and any written feedback. Reviews are

13
00:00:59.313 --> 00:01:00.453
read only here.
